    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Step Across Space and Call Creatures from Thin Air</p></blockquote><p>A Conjurer treats distance and matter as flexible guidelines rather than physical laws. Conjurers master magic that moves creatures instantly through space and summons creatures to fight on their behalf.</p><h3>Conjurer Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.jhfPCJvqDjLx5foq]{Benign Transposition}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.bS6KmJUvMGTgpE0e]{Conjuration Savant}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.EhrhlB5iLsA7RkRV]{Distant Transposition}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.EQWb7LHLovsjHU13]{Durable Summons}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.gHIC0HampaJsKq4E]{Focused Conjuration}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.V1iOX5rtXVvWIHbY]{Splintered Summons}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
